[PrintTextModified Text:大致探索一番后，<br>我来到地下的焚烧炉室。|#0202Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我想到杀死艾玛的方法了）|#0202Adv10_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（只要尸体上不留下证据，<br>　应该就不会被判定为【凶杀案】）|#0202Adv10_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来，就算要举行魔女审判，<br>我被人怀疑的可能性也很低。|#0202Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（为此，<br>　我要利用淋浴房的垃圾滑槽）|#0202Adv10_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

