; ========================================
; 回想ここまで
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:"（淋浴房隔音性能这么好，<br>　应该可以在那里避人耳目地执行计划）|#0202Adv10_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（计划很简单）|#0202Adv10_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（把艾玛叫出来杀了，<br>　再将她推下垃圾滑槽，<br>　之后焚烧炉就会把她的尸体烧个干净）|#0202Adv10_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我来到这里，正是为了调查焚烧炉。|#0202Adv10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是我打开炉盖，看向里面。|#0202Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:炉底积了一层黑灰，<br>若有若无的焦味飘进鼻腔。|#0202Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如此大型的焚烧炉，<br>一定能用高温将尸体彻底焚烧干净吧。|#0202Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（虽然有可能因为温度不够而烧不干净骨头……）|#0202Adv10_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但即便被人发现，<br>　也会被当作【事故】处理吧）|#0202Adv10_Hiro008|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（只要事先准备好<br>　能证明是【事故】的证据就可以）|#0202Adv10_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我打开魔女图鉴，再次确认规定。|#0202Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地下的焚烧炉每周一15时启动。<br>|#0202Adv10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……距离启动还有一点时间。<br>　在那之前要打磨好细节）|#0202Adv10_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正当我刚想合上盖子<br>准备走的时候。|#0202Adv10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……？|#0202Adv10_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:炉子里有什么奇异的东西闪了一下。|#0202Adv10_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那东西沉在炉底，<br>乍一看只是个发黑的金属片。|#0202Adv10_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知为何我有点好奇，便把它取了出来。<br>擦一擦表面，上面刻有文字。|#0202Adv10_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆ヒント：『金属片』入手
; ========================================
@UpdateWitchBook Id:16 Category:Note Version:1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:这是……|#0202Adv10_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:上面刻着我能看懂的文字。|#0202Adv10_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大概是以前的囚犯努力想留下些记录，<br>才把它刻在金属上的。|#0202Adv10_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:2

[PrintTextModified Text:我刚打算仔细阅读——|#0202Adv10_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:咦，这不是希罗亲吗……<br>你在这干嘛呢？|#0202Adv10_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:身后冷不防地传来可可的声音，<br>我吓了一跳，扭头看向她。|#0202Adv10_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:……没什么。<br>这里也是我平时巡视的目的地之一。|#0202Adv10_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（被人目击到我在焚烧炉室，<br>　会不会有麻烦——）|#0202Adv10_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我在脑海里做了片刻的模拟实验，<br>应该没什么问题。|#0202Adv10_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:倒是你，来这里做什么？|#0202Adv10_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco

[PrintTextModified Text:你不知道吗？我经常来这啦。<br>比如说想一个人静静的时候。|#0202Adv10_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:更确切地说……是【我推】联系我的时候。<br>这里没人来，所以能专心跟他聊天。|#0202Adv10_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（什么意思……？）|#0202Adv10_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

; ＠備考◆焦り

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊不跟你啰嗦了！没时间啦！<br>不管我干嘛都给我当没看见啊！|#0202Adv10_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子可可很嫌我碍事，<br>但她似乎已经放弃赶我走了。|#0202Adv10_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:2

[PrintTextModified Text:她急匆匆地拿出自己的手机，<br>贴在耳边。|#0202Adv10_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
