@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.4 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR11
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.4 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Flushed1,ArmR11
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～我挺好的呀？<br>没什么好担心的啦。<br>真是的每天唠唠叨叨的也不嫌烦……|#0202Adv10_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_40_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_40_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:不会啊，我很开心。<br>你一直都记着我嘛。|#0202Adv10_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:会的，我一定会回去的。<br>哎呀，都说了不要再担心人家啦！|#0202Adv10_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我更担心你啊爷爷！<br>整个人都虚弱了那么多……别那么难过啦……|#0202Adv10_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Cry1

; ＠備考◆涙声

[PrintTextModified Text:我会带给你笑容的……等着我。|#0202Adv10_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv10_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:可可放下手机，深深叹气。<br>然后她轻轻吸了下鼻子，带着一脸尴尬看向我。|#0202Adv10_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……你应该大致猜到了吧。|#0202Adv10_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。你的魔法是【千里眼】。<br>也就是说，你刚才是在跟某个<br>正在看你以前的影像或照片的人对话。|#0202Adv10_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:也就是你的家人。|#0202Adv10_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:都说了，那是全世界最最重要的【我推】啊。<br>当然了，这也是因为他每天都<br>看着我的照片跟我说话……|#0202Adv10_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然他听不见我的声音，<br>但我就是想回应他嘛。|#0202Adv10_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Flushed1

[PrintTextModified Text:我知道这么干很傻，不准看不起我啊！？|#0202Adv10_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:我没有看不起你。|#0202Adv10_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（反而对你刮目相看了才是。<br>　不过……）|#0202Adv10_Hiro021|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（如果可可每天都在听这么重要的亲人的声音，<br>　那么，她的渴归之心肯定不是一般的强）|#0202Adv10_Hiro022|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（希望她最好不要想不开……）|#0202Adv10_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但就算是这样，<br>我也没有余力对他人伸出援手。|#0202Adv10_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:见她想一个人静静地待一会，<br>我便离开了焚烧炉室。|#0202Adv10_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

